<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mixed in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 619.86, down 0.56.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.01.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 319 to 250.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 25,683,890 compared with 24,845,255 on Monday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
</text>
